# This repository contains the operating system template. Project instances may
# live in the local project area but are excluded to keep application code,
# artifacts, and secrets out of czxt.

项目区/本地实例/*
!项目区/本地实例/.gitkeep

# Track only the project card template. Concrete cards belong in local
# instances or explicitly approved examples.
项目配置/*.project.json
!项目配置/_模板.project.json

*.log
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
